four real screenshots read correctly, and three defects surfaced that synthetic images had hidden.
v2.7.0 added one-click calibration. v2.7.1 gated Automatic mode behind a 0.9 confidence bar and made
calibration prove itself by reading the located region. v2.7.2 ran the live loop end to end (monitor
thread, controller, store and statistics) against a fake screen, and made an uncapturable region say
so plainly instead of failing every scan.

